sh sessions\n4. **High-Value Token Use**: Learning complex concepts, solving tricky problems, meaningful discussions\n5. **Avoid Low-Value Use**: Repeating questions, unfocused conversations, mixing too many topics\n\n## Session Structure\n- **Start**: Clear goal, relevant files ready, context prepared\n- **During**: Stay focused, save outputs, document decisions\n- **End**: Save information, document next steps, plan next session"}}]]